    <string name="experimental_version_text_title">Release information :</string>
    <string name="experimental_version_text_label">Dear user,
        \nYou are currently using an experimental version of our application. This initial release aims to gather your valuable feedback to enhance the application according to your needs. Your data will be retained temporarily.
        \nA major update is planned for the Autumn, and your feedback will play a crucial role in its development. Your experience and suggestions will shape an even better application, fully meeting your expectations.
        \nThank you for your support and participation!
        \nThe My_Land Team.
    </string>
