    <string name="location_permission_title">Location Permission</string>
    <string name="location_permission_text_label">Location is an optional feature. However, if you activate the "location" feature, it will make the app usage more efficient, especially for interaction on the My_Land map. The app uses your location in the background, even when the app is not in use. This allows us to use this feature to generate non-advertising revenue within the application and to provide ads/support advertising. Features that use location in the background include interaction on the My_Land map and ad targeting.</string>
